VALUES (208759, 'tt0096806', NULL, 'American Rickshaw', 'American risciò', 'movie', 1989, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDqGRfan209vBldeKO6GiqwI61F.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bYRvM8no3CzZyVQCrzG5ARqTONs.jpg', 'After a stripper tricks him into filming a sex tape, Miami rickshaw runner Scott Edwards becomes embroiled in the murder of a televangelist''s son when he inadvertently takes the wrong videotape. With the help of the stripper and a witch, Edwards sets out to clear his name while avoiding the assassin dead-set on retrieving the tape.', NULL, NULL, 2.7955, 4.565, 0, 9.51, '2026-10-18 12:45:15', '2026-10-18 12:45:15')
