VALUES (6114, 'tt0103874', NULL, 'Bram Stoker''s Dracula', 'Bram Stoker''s Dracula', 'movie', 1992, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZbUxjY5DZ7RCxGwvzSEr4rThd1.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/88S6EYQBVyQktDfSqsB33I169jN.jpg', 'Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula''s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker''s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.', NULL, NULL, 10.6015, 7.451, 0, 7.38945714285714387e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-18 12:45:15')
