VALUES (194, 'tt0211915', NULL, 'Amélie', 'Le Fabuleux Destin d''Amélie Poulain', 'movie', 2001, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6n53UI4mX9QMfe2S0Pgt8mGebY1.jpg', 'At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?', NULL, NULL, 14.0223, 7.92, 0, 7.2944776119402988e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-18 12:45:15')
