VALUES (2028, 'tt0098258', NULL, 'Say Anything...', 'Say Anything...', 'movie', 1989, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkucKciFGSRalw6dJtsglWqOXMC.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bAdIO0Jt886Ad1eY9bDXXeCpXsV.jpg', 'Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane''s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it''s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.', NULL, NULL, 4.215, 7.0, 0, 1.82685714285714269e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-18 12:45:15')
