VALUES (53023, 'tt0058985', NULL, 'Happiness', 'Le Bonheur', 'movie', 1965, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg', 'Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda''s most provocative films, ''Le bonheur'' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.', NULL, NULL, 2.3429, 7.4, 0, 6.17, '2026-07-30 18:28:39', '2026-10-18 12:45:15')
